OL,3,GNEWSAFirefighters tackle blaze at
OL,4,Arecycling centre
OL,5,
OL,6,FFirefighters have urged people to avoid
OL,7,Fthe area as they continue to tackle a
OL,8,Fblaze at a recycling centre near
OL,9,FEckington.
OL,11,FDerbyshire Fire and Rescue Service said
OL,12,Fit was called at 19:54 BST on Saturday
OL,13,Fto a fire off Staveley Lane.
OL,15,FThe service said on Saturday evening
OL,16,Fsix engines, a water carrier and a
OL,17,Fcommand support unit were in
OL,18,Fattendance, but added on Sunday two
OL,19,Fcrews remained at the scene to continue
OL,20,Fdampening down.
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
